WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Thank you for visiting beautiful
blinds and shades dot com.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.200
My name is David Fear. I'm
the owner and operator.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.760
If you're in Northeast Indiana
and you're looking for a new

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.400
custom window treatment quote,
you've come to the right place.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.560
There's several reasons why I
think it'd be a great idea for

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.040
you to reach out to us and
schedule a free consultation.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.215
First, we bring the showroom
to your home or business.

00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:20.695
Coming to you allows us to
show you what your window treatments

00:00:20.695 --> 00:00:22.055
will look like on your windows.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.935
It also allows us to show
you fabric and color samples that

00:00:24.935 --> 00:00:27.815
you can compare to your
home's color scheme and decor.

00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:28.855
Ninety nine percent of the time,

00:00:28.855 --> 00:00:31.500
we can leave you with a
quote on-site while we're there for

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.780
your consultation.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.140
Second, we are a small
local Fort Wayne company.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.100
No showroom and
no franchise fees.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.900
This allows us to provide
you with very competitive pricing

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.060
for a wide range of
window treatments.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.735
Third, there is no job
too small or too big.

00:00:46.735 --> 00:00:49.055
We can help you solve your
needs for a single individual

00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:51.535
window treatment, or we can
help you fully automate,

00:00:51.535 --> 00:00:53.855
hardwire your entire
home or business.

00:00:53.855 --> 00:00:57.580
Fourth, we are committed to win
win relationship to our clients.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:01.340
Our consultations are highly
educational and absolutely no pressure.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.500
It is a privilege to be
invited into your home,

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.587
and we take that
privilege very seriously.

00:01:05.587 --> 00:01:06.867
If we cannot meet your needs,

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:09.427
it is our hope that the
education you will receive will

00:01:09.427 --> 00:01:12.067
help you on your journey to
finding the right solution for you.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:14.147
Thank you so much for taking
the time to listen to this

00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:16.827
introduction, and I hope
to meet you sometime soon.